# Generated CI working-copy artifact. verify-templates.yml's "Surface" step
# rebuilds this dir fresh each run (mkdir overlay + cp scratch/fixtures + the
# pyproject.toml.snippet). Never committed — a stale build here could ship
# outdated fixture content (e.g. a pre-review planted-secret version of
# violating.py). scratch/fixtures/ are the tracked source-of-truth, not this.
overlay/
